GlassWake KANON PULSE Route A

This consolidation contains new implementation code informed by pre-existing owner-controlled
GlassWake, GlassCP, SailorCP and Crumbonaut work. Exact source revisions, paths, classifications
and reuse decisions are recorded in docs/REUSE_MATRIX.md and docs/DEVPOST_DISCLOSURE.md.

The Crumbonaut S03 canonical worktree identifies its source as Apache-2.0 and includes the notice:
"GlassCP Agent Lens Starter — Copyright 2026 GlassCP contributors". Route A adapts small design
invariants such as deterministic canonical hashing, bounded RepairBriefs, LoopGuard semantics and
independent verification. It does not copy the historical repository wholesale.

The GlassWake source repository is marked "All Rights Reserved - private R&D pending IP review".
Route A uses independently written compatible equivalents and does not grant permission to publish
the underlying private R&D code. Public distribution or Devpost publication requires owner/IP review.

